00:04:51.478 --> 00:04:53.977
It really, really, really,
really means a lot to me,

00:04:53.977 --> 00:04:55.247
and I hope you're enjoying it.

00:04:55.247 --> 00:04:56.682
Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:04:56.682 --> 00:04:57.912
I believe in you.

00:04:57.912 --> 00:04:59.897
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself,

00:04:59.897 --> 00:05:01.707
