00:05:20.572 --> 00:05:22.514
- My question is, I'm entrepreneur.

00:05:22.514 --> 00:05:25.832
It's very great, but
not all days are great

00:05:25.832 --> 00:05:28.584
in a company, so what
are your tips and trick

00:05:28.584 --> 00:05:30.251
for, you know, tough days?

00:05:30.251 --> 00:05:33.061
- I think there's massive
confusion around entrepreneurship.

00:05:33.061 --> 00:05:34.903
Entrepreneurship sucks.

00:05:34.903 --> 00:05:36.304
I mean, it's lonely.

00:05:36.304 --> 00:05:37.443
It's high-risk.

00:05:37.443 --> 00:05:39.034
I mean, I can't live without it,

00:05:39.034 --> 00:05:40.603
but it's like a bad boyfriend, right,

00:05:40.603 --> 00:05:44.132
or girlfriend, right, like
there's a ton of bad days being

00:05:44.132 --> 00:05:46.556
an entrepreneur, not to mention 98%

00:05:46.556 --> 00:05:48.333
of entrepreneurial
ventures are going to fail,

00:05:48.333 --> 00:05:51.065
so there's going to be a
really bad in your future.

00:05:51.065 --> 00:05:51.898
(audience laughs)

00:05:51.898 --> 00:05:54.562
- You know, hopefully, not for you.

00:05:54.562 --> 00:05:55.599
Or any of you.

00:05:55.599 --> 00:05:58.462
You know, for me, I don't, I think it's

00:05:58.462 --> 00:05:59.563
a very personal question.

00:05:59.563 --> 00:06:01.261
I think it's how you're wired.

00:06:01.261 --> 00:06:03.551
I'm so all-in entrepreneur.

00:06:03.551 --> 00:06:05.177
I prefer the pain.

00:06:05.177 --> 00:06:06.758
I think one of the reasons
I love the Jets so much

00:06:06.758 --> 00:06:08.383
is cause they bring me so much pain.

00:06:08.383 --> 00:06:10.633
You know, I love the climb.

00:06:12.379 --> 00:06:15.267
To me, the setback is exciting.

00:06:15.267 --> 00:06:17.481
I love when something goes wrong.

00:06:17.481 --> 00:06:19.785
It's where I shine the most.

00:06:19.785 --> 00:06:21.494
But that's not for everybody, right?

00:06:21.494 --> 00:06:23.177
I mean, it can be very difficult,

00:06:23.177 --> 00:06:24.781
and when you start affecting your life

00:06:24.781 --> 00:06:26.982
and your loved ones and
all the other things,

00:06:26.982 --> 00:06:28.647
it can get real nasty.

00:06:28.647 --> 00:06:31.558
To me, the way I handle things even

00:06:31.558 --> 00:06:34.399
in the few rare days
when I really struggle,

00:06:34.399 --> 00:06:36.609
I take a real step back and make pretend

00:06:36.609 --> 00:06:38.092
that somebody called me and told me

00:06:38.092 --> 00:06:41.413
that my mother or daughter were killed.

00:06:41.413 --> 00:06:43.028
And I know that's very dark.

00:06:43.028 --> 00:06:45.608
I apologize, but it's really what I do.

00:06:45.608 --> 00:06:48.069
I literally am able to, at my deepest

00:06:48.069 --> 00:06:51.049
most struggling moment within business,

00:06:51.049 --> 00:06:53.241
take a step back and remind myself

00:06:53.241 --> 00:06:55.647
I could make a drillion dollars tomorrow

00:06:55.647 --> 00:06:59.450
on Bitcoin, and if something bad happened

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:02.201
to the people I love the most
then it wold mean nothing.

00:07:02.201 --> 00:07:06.284
And it very consistently
rewires me very quickly.

00:07:07.144 --> 00:07:09.352
I just put business in perspective.

00:07:09.352 --> 00:07:12.789
At the end of the day,
you know, it's money.

00:07:12.789 --> 00:07:13.668
For me, it's not really money.

00:07:13.668 --> 00:07:17.095
It's my legacy, so I get
hurt by it a little bit more,

00:07:17.095 --> 00:07:21.247
but yeah, you know, I
put it in perspective.

00:07:21.247 --> 00:07:22.930
It's money, and you know what?

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:25.613
Up until I had a daughter,
even while I was married,

00:07:25.613 --> 00:07:28.759
up until when I had Mischa four years ago,

00:07:28.759 --> 00:07:31.713
I secretly wanted to lose all my money.

00:07:31.713 --> 00:07:35.671
I had this weird, twisted, dark fantasy

00:07:35.671 --> 00:07:38.499
of losing everything just to rise again

00:07:38.499 --> 00:07:40.395
like a phoenix and remind you.

00:07:40.395 --> 00:07:43.206
(audience laughs)

00:07:43.206 --> 00:07:45.651
- You, I mean, obviously, you
can't come on a show like this

00:07:45.651 --> 00:07:47.991
