00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.726
I don't give a toss if
people have a real problem

00:08:59.726 --> 00:09:01.976
with me, you know, having--

00:09:02.861 --> 00:09:05.869
(audience applauds)

00:09:05.869 --> 00:09:06.702
Thank you.

00:09:08.173 --> 00:09:09.397
I have a different perspective on life.

00:09:09.397 --> 00:09:10.510
I've lost a lot of great things,

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:12.308
